      "side": 1,
      "message": "Kiyoung, I left comments on some implementation details. Aside, I also started implementing the dep replacement logic as part of b/236192696 in aosp/2151711, but never got around to finishing it till recently\n\nMy understanding of the differences are\n1. This CL does the dep renaming at the DepsMutator phase\n2. The other CL does a dep \"forwarding/redirection\" at the GenerateAndroidBuildActions phase\n\nInitially, I was leaning towards Option 1 as well, but realized that it might not work for apexes, since apex variants are created in the _post_ deps phase",
      "revId": "a34e9ef71f950ff32f83dd6cebb6122f003e7679",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
