        "id": 1146974
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-08-01T02:11:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We are defining API surfaces with stable interfaces, such as SDK, NDK and LLNDK. Those are already provided as stub libraries. I don\u0027t think we need apex variants for those stub libraries.\nAlso, soong can generate apex variants for non-stub files in post deps mutator after the dep renaming in option 1.\nAm I missing something?",
      "parentUuid": "bc4581b1_5a83fa12",
      "revId": "a34e9ef71f950ff32f83dd6cebb6122f003e7679",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "3a99b0a4_bf586119",
